## ⚠️ Disclaimer

This repository documents operations that **destroy data**, including full-disk
reformatting and repartitioning. Hardware-specific values — device paths, partition
sizes, sector counts, model numbers — apply to **one specific machine** audited on
2026-08-14.

**Verify every device path against your own system before running any command here.**
A `/dev/nvme0n1` on your machine may not be the disk you think it is. The authors
accept no liability for data loss.
